  "description": "Known as the \"Prince Among Shamans,\" Yohan is famous for his supernatural second sight. But in reality, he uses social media to collect info on his clients as his personal spirit, Donga, is too lazy to help! One day, the CEO of a successful IT venture firm visits Yohan's shop, trailed by a powerful spirit! An unlikely romance takes flight, as Yohan tries to help this CEO come to terms with his otherworldly friend. \n\n(Source: Tappytoon) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes 93 regular chapters, prologue and 12 side story extras The side stories are R19.*",
